.edu/library/tools/computers.html","source_title":"Computers in the Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.iwu.edu/map/","access_notes":"Computers are primarily for academic use by IWU students, faculty, and staff; specialized applications are installed only on designated machines.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"iwu-hansen-student-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Hansen Student Center","title":"Make Hansen the Group’s Coordination Point","subtitle":"Student-center spaces for meeting, studying, relaxing, and campus programs","notes":"Meet near the information desk, use a computer station for a quick print, or reserve an appropriate space well before a planned event.","short_summary":"A multipurpose student center connecting informal gathering areas, student organizations, event spaces, services, and dining.","evidence_claim":"The university says Hansen Student Center includes areas to relax, study, or meet friends, plus an information desk, computer stations, student-organization offices, event support, bookstore, and Tommy’s dining.","source_url":"https://www.iwu.edu/student-involvement/hansen/","source_title":"Hansen Student Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.iwu.edu/map/","access_notes":"Current posted in-session hours are 7:30 a.m.–10 p.m. weekdays and 10 a.m.–10 p.m. weekends; summer hours differ. Reservable spaces use 25Live.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"iwu-cns-atrium","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Center for Natural Sciences Atrium","title":"Catch Up Between Science Classes","subtitle":"Daylit gathering space inside the Center for Natural Sciences","notes":"Use the atrium for a brief conversation between classes, while 